{"game":"heroes98-map","v":1,"name":"Серный перевал","about":"Третья миссия кампании «Жар».","w":80,"h":80,"levels":1,"players":[{"who":"human","factions":["forge"],"team":0,"town":null}],"goals":{"win":[{"kind":"flag","flag":"n_never","text":"Выполнить задания миссии"}],"lose":[{"kind":"all"},{"kind":"hero","hid":"irga"}]},"forbid":[],"heart":null,"next":27,"ter":[""],"road":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/ACABBwBIAQEABwEBAD4BCQAJARMAKgEBAE4BAQD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8Awg=="],"river":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8AGQ=="],"over":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8AGQ=="],"objs":[{"id":1,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":40,"r":42,"owner":-1,"unit":"whitespirit","count":16,"max":48,"mood":"fierce","tag":"convoy","route":[[40,42],[50,40],[58,38],[70,40],[78,40]],"pace":5},{"id":2,"l":0,"t":"dwell-steamling","c":6,"r":8,"owner":-1},{"id":3,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":8,"r":10,"owner":-1,"unit":"salamander","count":14,"max":42,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":4,"l":0,"t":"sulfurspring","c":4,"r":20,"owner":-1},{"id":5,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":6,"r":22,"owner":-1,"unit":"obsidianspider","count":8,"max":24,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":6,"l":0,"t":"oremine","c":12,"r":74,"owner":-1},{"id":7,"l":0,"t":"artifact","c":30,"r":32,"owner":-1,"art":"tinring"},{"id":8,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":31,"r":33,"owner":-1,"unit":"caster","count":6,"max":18,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":9,"l":0,"t":"dwell-caster","c":46,"r":34,"owner":-1},{"id":10,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":48,"r":36,"owner":-1,"unit":"hammerer","count":20,"max":60,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":11,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":40,"r":46,"owner":-1,"unit":"mercenaries","count":30,"max":90,"mood":"fierce"},{"id":12,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":60,"r":44,"owner":-1,"unit":"whitespirit","count":10,"max":30,"mood":"fierce"},{"id":13,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":10,"r":60,"owner":-1},{"id":14,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":24,"r":52,"owner":-1},{"id":15,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":34,"r":42,"owner":-1},{"id":16,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":50,"r":40,"owner":-1},{"id":17,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":66,"r":36,"owner":-1},{"id":18,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":6,"r":30,"owner":-1},{"id":19,"l":0,"t":"res-sulfur","c":14,"r":70,"owner":-1},{"id":20,"l":0,"t":"res-sulfur","c":26,"r":40,"owner":-1},{"id":21,"l":0,"t":"res-sulfur","c":54,"r":42,"owner":-1},{"id":22,"l":0,"t":"res-ore","c":4,"r":60,"owner":-1},{"id":23,"l":0,"t":"res-ore","c":48,"r":46,"owner":-1},{"id":24,"l":0,"t":"campfire","c":22,"r":42,"owner":-1},{"id":25,"l":0,"t":"campfire","c":62,"r":42,"owner":-1},{"id":26,"l":0,"t":"signstone","c":18,"r":44,"owner":-1,"text":"Серный перевал. Обозам держаться дороги, дорога держится сама."}],"heroes":[{"owner":0,"hid":"irga","c":4,"r":74,"l":0,"tag":"irga","army":[{"unit":"apprentice","count":50},{"unit":"hammerer","count":20},{"unit":"salamander","count":16},{"unit":"obsidianspider","count":10},{"unit":"caster","count":6}]}],"events":[],"scenes":"event day 1 -> h3_start\nevent day 5 -> h3_rider\nevent defeat convoy -> h3_caught\nevent arrive convoy -> h3_gone\nevent day 10 -> h3_late\n\n@h3_start\nshow irga left\nshow ilm right\nilm: Обоз Престола идёт через Серный перевал. Охрана белая, возницы наши.\nirga: Сколько у нас времени?\nilm: До конца второй недели. Потом он спустится в долину, и там его уже не догнать.\ngoal add convoy \"Перехватить обоз с цепями\" to convoy\ngoal lose day 14\nsay Обоз идёт по дороге каждый день. Его видно сквозь туман войны.\nend\n\n@h3_rider\nif not flag got\nshow ilm right\nilm: Гонец с перевала. Возницы обоза наши, из Серной слободы. Они не хотят везти цепи, но их держат белые.\nirga: Тогда бить будем охрану, а не возниц.\nilm: Охрана из духов. Их не уговоришь и не подкупишь.\nend\nend\n\n@h3_late\nif not flag got\nshow ilm right\nilm: Обоз прошёл середину перевала. Четыре дня, не больше.\nend\nend\n\n@h3_caught\nshow irga left\nshow ilm right\nilm: Обоз наш. Звеньев только половина.\nirga: Где остальное?\nilm: Ушло раньше, другой дорогой. Возницы говорят, что старшие сами разделили цепь, чтобы не везти всё одним обозом.\nirga: Умно. Значит, вторая половина уже у Престола.\ngoal done convoy\nset got\nkeep chain_half\nif day 10\nelse\nkeep convoy_fast\nend\nwin\nend\n\n@h3_gone\nshow ilm right\nilm: Обоз спустился в долину. Мы опоздали.\nlose\nend\n"}